msgstr "附注标签"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AnnotatedTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A content-addressed Git tag object with its own bytes, target and recorded tag name. It is a SourceNode artifact, distinct from a mutable tag ref, a release event and a folksonomy Tag."
msgstr "具有自身字节、目标及记录标签名的内容寻址 Git 标签对象。它是 SourceNode 制品，区别于可变标签引用、发布事件及民间分类 Tag。"


