msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggerIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the explicit taggerIdentity value with its source and observation scope."
msgstr "连同来源及观察范围保留显式 taggerIdentity 值。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggerIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
