msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "将 ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint 应用于显式限定范围的来源记录。"


