msgstr "来源记录受 gmeow:TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint 约束。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "避免将 TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint 视为遍历、哈希或 Git 执行证书。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "将 TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint 应用于显式限定范围的来源记录。"


