msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
