msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "same represented tree path terminal constraint"
msgstr "同一表示树路径终端约束"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one root tree, identical represented path literals name the same terminal entry. Cross-encoding byte identity and actual traversal remain consumer obligations."
msgstr "在同一根树下，表示相同的路径字面量命名同一终端条目。跨编码字节身份及实际遍历仍由使用方负责。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint."
msgstr "来源记录受 gmeow:TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint 约束。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded author, committer or tagger identity in a version-control object, retaining its historical raw bytes independently of the currently canonical agent. Superseded identities remain retained rather than rewritten."
msgstr "版本控制对象中记录的作者、提交者或标签创建者身份，独立于当前规范化智能体保留历史原始字节。被取代身份予以保留而不被重写。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Ref|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A version-control reference to an object, including commit, tree, blob or annotated tag targets. It is distinct from the immutable object it names; observed target claims retain their own provenance and scope."
msgstr "指向对象的版本控制引用，包括提交、树、blob 或附注标签目标。它区别于所命名的不可变对象；观察所得目标主张保留其自身溯源及范围。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/releaseTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The folksonomy Tag associated with a release, retaining the existing tag classification surface. Use releaseRef for a VCS tag reference; this property neither names an AnnotatedTag object nor changes the sort of existing Tag values."
msgstr "与发布关联的民间分类 Tag，保留现有标签分类表面。版本控制标签引用使用 releaseRef；此属性既不命名 AnnotatedTag 对象，也不改变现有 Tag 值的种类。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorIdentityString|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The raw author, committer or tagger identity bytes recorded in a version-control object header, typically Name <email>, preserved independently of canonical agent resolution."
msgstr "版本控制对象头字段中记录的原始作者、提交者或标签创建者身份字节，通常为 Name <email>，独立于规范化智能体解析予以保留。"
msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Tree Entry"
msgstr "树条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A named pointer within a source tree, carrying a name, Git mode and content-addressed target. Regular files, executable files and symlinks target a Blob; directories target a SourceTree; gitlinks target a Commit. AnnotatedTag is never a tree-entry target. Entry identity belongs to its containing tree."
msgstr "源树中的命名指针，带有名称、Git 模式和内容寻址目标。普通文件、可执行文件和符号链接指向 Blob；目录指向 SourceTree；gitlink 指向 Commit。AnnotatedTag 绝不是树条目目标。条目标识归属于其所在树。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/treeEntryObject|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree entry object"
msgstr "树条目对象"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/treeEntryObject|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The single content-addressed target of a tree entry: Blob for regular files, executables and symlinks; SourceTree for directories; Commit for gitlinks. AnnotatedTag is excluded, and Commit retains its Activity/Event sort."
msgstr "树条目的唯一内容寻址目标：普通文件、可执行文件和符号链接使用 Blob；目录使用 SourceTree；gitlink 使用 Commit。排除 AnnotatedTag，Commit 保留其 Activity/Event 类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/treeEntryMode|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree entry mode"
msgstr "树条目模式"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/treeEntryObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:treeEntryObject is functional: one tree entry names exactly one target, a Blob, SourceTree or gitlink Commit according to its recorded mode. The characteristic fixes target multiplicity; the class and mode laws govern target kind."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:treeEntryObject 具有函数性：一个树条目恰好指定一个目标，按其记录模式为 Blob、SourceTree 或 gitlink Commit。此特征规定目标数量；类及模式定律规定目标类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryDirectoryTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree directory target constraint"
msgstr "树目录目标约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryDirectoryTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A tree entry with directory mode 040000 or 40000 targets a SourceTree."
msgstr "目录模式为 040000 或 40000 的树条目指向 SourceTree。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryBlobTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree blob target constraint"
msgstr "树 blob 目标约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryBlobTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A tree entry with regular-file, executable-file or symlink mode 100644, 100755 or 120000 targets a Blob."
msgstr "普通文件、可执行文件或符号链接模式为 100644、100755 或 120000 的树条目指向 Blob。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryGitlinkTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree gitlink target constraint"
msgstr "树 gitlink 目标约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreeEntryGitlinkTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A tree entry with gitlink mode 160000 targets a Commit, retaining the commit’s Event sort."
msgstr "gitlink 模式为 160000 的树条目指向 Commit，并保留提交的 Event 类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/treeEntryMode|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The recorded octal Git mode string of a tree entry, preserving its spelling and leading zeroes. Modes 100644, 100755 and 120000 require a Blob target; directory spellings 040000 and 40000 require SourceTree; gitlink mode 160000 requires Commit. Functional: one mode per entry. These kind constraints do not parse or verify an object’s bytes."
msgstr "树条目记录的八进制 Git 模式字符串，保留其拼写和前导零。模式 100644、100755 和 120000 要求 Blob 目标；目录写法 040000 和 40000 要求 SourceTree；gitlink 模式 160000 要求 Commit。具有函数性：每个条目一个模式。这些类别约束不解析或验证对象字节。"
